From 247a7879233f9206ff617c4a9d934e749031565b Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ozodbek Bosimov <bosimovozodbekdev@gmail.com>
Date: Wed, 29 Jul 2026 23:15:34 +0500
Subject: [PATCH] fix(a11y): accessibility, responsive TOC positioning, and
 admin picker modal improvements

- Floating TOC:
  * Enable toggle button, focus-within, and hover expansion for accessible navigation.
  * Adjust responsive media query (min-width: 82rem / ~1312px) and positioning calc() to prevent overlapping main article container.
  * Update click navigation to preserve native history via pushState, focus headings, and smooth scroll.
  * Add visual indicator line and font weight for active TOC link state (WCAG 1.4.1).
  * Add reduced-motion guard for smooth transitions and scrolling.
  * Custom thin scrollbar for long TOC lists.

- Admin Block Builder & Toolkit:
  * Upgrade builder modal to a fully accessible dialog pattern (role=dialog, aria-modal, focus trap, Esc key listener, focus restoration).
  * Ensure all form labels bind dynamically to generated input IDs (for/id linkage).
  * Redesign close button with clean SVG icon, hover/focus-visible states.
  * Complete ARIA tablist pattern with keyboard arrow navigation.
  * Add consistent :focus-visible outlines across all toolkit controls and buttons.
  * Asset version bumped to 20260728_36.
